OL,3,GNEWSA'I'm 87 and I've finished 400
OL,4,AParkruns'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 87-year-old man who completed his
OL,7,F400th Parkrun on Saturday said he
OL,8,Fthinks running may have added years to
OL,9,Fhis life.
OL,11,FDavid Carbert joined the Humber Bridge
OL,12,FCountry Park event 10 years ago because
OL,13,Fhe didn't want to sit at home doing
OL,14,Fnothing.
OL,16,FCarbert, who said he was feeling
OL,17,F"fairly fit and well", has no intention
OL,18,Fof stopping and hopes to reach his
OL,19,Ftarget of 500 Parkruns, when he'll be
OL,20,Fnearly 90.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
